cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Bootstrapped Watershed"
abstract: >-
  Few-shot instance segmentation for ZooScan plankton imagery. Frozen DINOv3
  features train a shallow MLP on three annotated crops, which pseudo-labels
  further crops to supervise a U-Net segmenter; watershed post-processing
  recovers individual organisms.
type: software
